Run from the repository root. Start a port-forward to the lab database:
  kubectl port-forward svc/postgres 15432:5432

Install migrations/requirements.txt into a virtual environment.
For an existing database initialized with app/seed.sql, run once:
  alembic stamp 0001
Then apply the email migration:
  alembic upgrade head
  alembic current

The baseline represents the existing schema; it does not create tables.
Do not stamp an uninitialized database or stamp 0002 before applying it.
